  "description": "Fuaran.Core.Relation — questions over a finite relation, answered once and totally: the strongly-connected components dependencies-first, the cycles (as data, never a divergence), the nodes on a cycle, the topological sort, the forward closure from a seed set, the inverse relation (dependents), and where a chain of redirects ends. One iterative Tarjan pass — no recursion depth bound, no fuel — linear in nodes plus edges whatever the number of paths; every answer a function of the edge set alone. Generic over any comparable node. FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean.",
